{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Refactor Spring XD architecture by extracting message bus, serialization codecs, and type converters into modular components (spring-bus and spring-cloud-dataflow) to support decoupled dependencies.",
    "Expose a configurable logging directory property (e.g., xd.log.dir) in Spring XD configuration files and startup scripts, defaulting to ${xd.home}/logs when unspecified.",
    "Standardize Admin SPI implementations on the ModuleLauncher abstraction for both local single-node (SingleNodeAdmin) and Diego/Receptor (CF Lattice) execution environments.",
    "Fix Sqoop module Teradata integration by updating connection manager instantiation, handling classloader issues, and preventing NullPointerExceptions when the native JDBC driver is used directly."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Development and testing environments have access to Java 17+ and Spring Framework build infrastructure.",
    "A test instance or simulator for CF Lattice / Diego Receptor API is available for developing and testing the Diego Admin SPI implementation.",
    "The target repositories (spring-bus and spring-cloud-dataflow) exist or are established as part of the ecosystem refactoring.",
    "Teradata JDBC drivers and Hortonworks Teradata connector binaries can be acquired or mocked for unit and integration testing."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "Resolve Sqoop Teradata Driver NPE & Connection Manager Support",
      "activity_description": "Investigate and fix the NullPointerException occurring with direct Teradata JDBC driver invocation in the Sqoop module, ensuring correct classloading and support for both TeraDriver and TeradataConnManager.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "Implement Configurable Logging Directory",
      "activity_description": "Modify Spring XD log configuration files (Log4j/Logback) and startup scripts to allow external overrides for the log directory (e.g., /var/logs/spring-xd for RPM installations).",
      "most_likely_effort": 12
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "Extract Message-Bus Component to spring-bus",
      "activity_description": "Migrate the message-bus module from the Spring XD repository into the spring-bus repository, configure Maven publishing, and update Spring XD to consume it as an external dependency.",
      "most_likely_effort": 30
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "Migrate Input/Output Type Conversion to spring-cloud-dataflow",
      "activity_description": "Extract tuple and payload type conversion classes into spring-cloud-dataflow to enable custom module domain object production and consumption.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Extract Serialization Codec to spring-bus",
      "activity_description": "Move serialization codec implementations (such as Kryo and Tuple codecs) to spring-bus and update Spring XD module dependencies.",
      "most_likely_effort": 20
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Develop Singlenode XD Admin SPI Implementation",
      "activity_description": "Design and implement a single-JVM Singlenode Admin SPI based on ModuleLauncher to enable running data pipelines locally.",
      "most_likely_effort": 40
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Develop Diego/Receptor XD Admin SPI Implementation",
      "activity_description": "Implement the XD Admin SPI for CF Lattice / Diego using the Receptor API and ModuleLauncher to deploy and manage data pipeline modules on Diego.",
      "most_likely_effort": 48
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-8",
      "activity_name": "Spike & Prototype s-c-s Module Self-Registration with Service Discovery",
      "activity_description": "Investigate Spring Cloud Stream module self-registration mechanisms with service discovery services on Cloud Foundry and prototype orchestration within Spring XD runtime.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-9",
      "activity_name": "Integration Testing and Verification",
      "activity_description": "Perform end-to-end integration testing across refactored dependencies, local singlenode admin, and external module execution.",
      "most_likely_effort": 26
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 240
  }
}
```

